{"Title":"An Act establishing a sick leave bank for Eric J. Iwaniec","BillNumber":"H5053","DocketNumber":"HD5334","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"DRB1","Name":"Donald R. Berthiaume, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DRB1","ResponseDate":"2024-08-27T11:26:20.543"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"DRB1","Name":"Donald R. Berthiaume, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DRB1","ResponseDate":"2024-08-27T11:26:20.5433333"},{"Id":"PJD0","Name":"Peter J. Durant","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PJD0","ResponseDate":"2024-08-29T15:38:45.5766667"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"PJD0","Name":"Peter J. Durant","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PJD0","ResponseDate":"2024-08-27T11:44:16.193"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H5053/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Berthiaume of Spencer and Senator Durant, a joint petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Donald R. Berthiaume, Jr., and Peter J. Durant for legislation to establish a sick leave bank for Eric J. Iwaniec, an employee of the Department of the Trial Court.  The Judiciary.","DocumentText":"\tSection 1. Notwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, the Massachusetts Trial Court shall establish a sick leave bank for Eric J. Iwaniec, an employee of the Department. Any employee of the Department may voluntarily contribute 1 or more sick, personal or vacation days to the sick leave bank for use by Eric Iwaniec. If Eric Iwanieci terminates employment with the Department or requests to dissolve the sick leave bank, any remaining time in the sick leave bank shall be transferred to the extended illness leave bank. Sick leave bank days shall not be used for absences unrelated to the illness or disability that necessitated the establishment of the sick leave bank as determined by the Department.\r\n\tSection 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J19","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J19"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"H5053","Branch":"House","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H5053/Branches/House/Amendments/1/"}]}